# Packages of the CUDA 12 environment, envs/cuda12 (roadmap step 2.6): the fork with CuPy for
# CUDA 12 and its toolkit from PyPI (the [cuda12] extra), to run the parity tests with a CUDA 12
# runtime and NVRTC 12 on the same GPU. Compiled into cuda12.txt with the versions of dev.txt as
# constraints, except its CUDA 13 packages, so that both environments run the same versions of
# everything else:
#   uv pip compile requirements/cuda12.in -c <(grep -vE '^(cuda-|cupy-|nvidia-)' requirements/dev.txt) \
#       --python-version 3.12 -o requirements/cuda12.txt
numpy
scipy
matplotlib
hdf5storage
requests
segyio
pyopencl
pocl-binary-distribution
cupy-cuda12x[ctk]
cuda-core[cu12]
pytest
pytest-timeout
ruff
setuptools
wheel
